{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f YOIN: The Shadow of Dawn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken without a voice. Without a body. Without time. Only one desire burns in your soul: <strong>to reclaim what was once your home.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world painted with ink and melancholy, you are a wandering spirit returning from the beyond to reclaim your village, now destroyed by invaders. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae What is YOIN?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOIN: The Shadow of Dawn</strong> is a 2D top-down adventure and tactical action game set in a dreamlike feudal Japan. You are a ghost, invisible to humans, yet their life force hurts you. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd2e Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7b <strong>Play as a vengeful spirit:</strong> invisible to the naked eye, but perceptible through your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd70\ufe0f Time is your enemy:</strong> you lose energy simply by existing in the world of the living.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f <strong>Reclaim your essence by defeating soldiers:</strong> only through killing do you recover life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Absorb energy from nature:</strong> trees, plants, and surrounding objects are your arsenal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Tactical stealth combat:</strong> your invisibility is your power, but also your vulnerability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Fragmented narrative:</strong> explore ruins, shrines, and cemeteries to discover who you were\u2026 and why you came back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 Experience-based progression:</strong> unlock abilities, improve attributes, and unveil your destiny.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf12 <strong>Hand-drawn art design:</strong> each area has a unique aesthetic inspired by Japanese mythology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>You are death returned.</u></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Explore. Survive. Remember. Discover.</u></strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3750350?t=1760317136","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750350/07139c34cc142b35b96753f813fea836044da14c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760317136","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750350/ee818e356e4461def6cc699ce9b88741c18d76af/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760317136","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750350/ee818e356e4461def6cc699ce9b88741c18d76af/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760317136","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f YOIN: The Shadow of Dawn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken without a voice. Without a body. Without time. Only one desire burns in your soul: <strong>to reclaim what was once your home.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world painted with ink and melancholy, you are a wandering spirit returning from the beyond to reclaim your village, now destroyed by invaders. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><stron